%% Workflow step with input and output assignments: One step of a workflow run: it executes a workflow function, and its input and output assignments say which parameter of the function each piece of data fills. Uses the PMDco 3.1.2 workflow terms; 'fills parameter' is a proposed relation.

    Run["<b>Workflow run</b><br>PMD_0000016 workflow run"]:::local
    Definition["<b>Workflow definition</b><br>PMD_0000012 workflow definition"]:::local
    Step["<b>Workflow step</b><br>PMD_0000011 workflow node"]:::local
    Function["<b>Function</b><br>PMD_0000010 workflow function"]:::local
    InputParameter["<b>Input parameter</b><br>PMD_0000014 input specification"]:::local
    OutputParameter["<b>Output parameter</b><br>PMD_0000015 output specification"]:::local
    InputAssignment["<b>Input assignment</b><br>PMD_0000066 input assignment"]:::local
    OutputAssignment["<b>Output assignment</b><br>PMD_0000067 output assignment"]:::local
    InputData["<b>Input data</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity"]:::local
    OutputData["<b>Output data</b><br>PMD_0025035 calculation datum"]:::local

    Run -. "executes<br>STATO_0000102" .-> Definition
    Definition -. "has part<br>BFO_0000051" .-> Function
    Run -. "has part<br>BFO_0000051" .-> Step
    Step -. "executes<br>STATO_0000102" .-> Function
    Function -. "has part<br>BFO_0000051" .-> InputParameter
    Function -. "has part<br>BFO_0000051" .-> OutputParameter
    Step -. "has part<br>BFO_0000051" .-> InputAssignment
    Step -. "has part<br>BFO_0000051" .-> OutputAssignment
    InputAssignment -. "fills parameter" .-> InputParameter
    OutputAssignment -. "fills parameter" .-> OutputParameter
    InputAssignment -. "has participant<br>RO_0000057" .-> InputData
    OutputAssignment -. "has participant<br>RO_0000057" .-> OutputData

    classDef local fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a

